-//   BCB6 L183: Dia.Pos("Arm2_")==0  means NOT found (AnsiString.Pos is 1-based,
-//              returns 0 when absent).  Correct std port: find()==npos.
-//   BCB6 L185: Dia.SubString(6, Dia.Length())  starts at 1-based char 6, i.e.
