+//  "a kcode==0 notice still open" for the Teach Arm Cell job. ArmCellPopupUpLive (ArmCellLive.cpp, HT160 uteach IsFaultPopupShowing)
+//  sees golden's fNote / MyMessageBox show flags; a notice is posted without fNote (ruling 20260923 "not blocking") and stays on the
+//  page until its dialog.notifyAck retires it, so GO went ahead under it. true = the slot holds a notice not yet acknowledged
+//  (what = the refusal text); a blocking alarm (kBlocking) is not this -- it sets fNote->fShow while it waits.
+//  wb_serve.cpp W906_NoticeBoxPending (EOF) asks it of g_alarmSlot; tests/test_notice_ack.cpp [P].
+inline bool NoticePendingWhy(const AlarmSlot& slot, std::string& what)
+{
+    if (slot.kind != AlarmSlot::kNotice || slot.requestId.empty()) { what.clear(); return false; }
+    what = "通知框（requestId " + slot.requestId + "）還開著，還沒按確認";
+    return true;
+}
